||{{Green|+20%}}
|-
|}

The base [[Sea Creatures#Sea Creature Weight|Weight]] for '''Inkling''' is {{Green|2,875}}, resulting in a catch chance of {{Chance|28.75%|1|3.48|sea creatures}} in [[Sea Creatures#Hotspot|Hotspot Sea Creatures]] pool with all Sea Creatures unlocked. Certain modifiers can be used to increase it:

